  I'm pleased to announce the organization of the NannyMUD Times Journalists.

  The Journalists are players that have contributed in some way to the
  NannyMUD Times, and are interested in keeping the Times current and
  the printing presses running.
  
  The NannyMUD Times is currently accepting members for the Journalists
  club. If you're interested in helping with the paper and becoming a 
  Journalist, you can apply by submitting an article at the newspaper stand.
  
  -Astrodeath, Editor in Chief

